{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"누적 합","desc":"<p>각 위치까지의 <b>누적 합</b> 벡터를 돌려주는 <code>cumulative(x)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>c(1, 2, 3)</code> → <code>c(1, 3, 6)</code></p>","solution":"cumulative <- function(x) {\n  cumsum(x)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>cumsum()</code> 함수가 있어요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"cumulative(c(1, 2, 3, 4))","expected":[1,3,6,10],"visible":true},{"call":"cumulative(5)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"cumulative(c(2, -1, 3))","expected":[2,1,4],"visible":false},{"call":"cumulative(numeric(0))","expected":[],"visible":false}],"starter":"cumulative <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-323","hints":["<p><code>cumsum()</code> 함수가 있어요.</p>","<p>코드의 <b>뼈대</b>예요. <code>___</code> 자리에 들어갈 내용을 직접 채워 보세요.</p><pre class=\"out\">cumulative &lt;- function(x) {\n  cumsum(___)\n}</pre>","<p>거의 정답이에요. 코드를 읽고 <b>왜 이렇게 되는지</b> 이해한 뒤, 닫고 직접 다시 써 보세요.</p><pre class=\"out\">cumulative &lt;- function(x) {\n  cumsum(x)\n}\n</pre>"]}